# Vercel turns every file under api/ into a serverless function, test files
# included. api/plaid.test.js has been deployed as a live function this whole
# time — it does nothing, and it occupies one of the plan's twelve slots.
#
# That ceiling is not theoretical: api/ was sitting at exactly 12, so adding a
# single test file failed the build outright, with an error that names neither
# the limit nor the file. Excluding tests frees a slot and stops a test ever
# costing one again.
*.test.js
*.test.jsx
